sequenceDiagram
  participant A as برنامه (librados)
  participant O as Objecter
  participant P as OSD primary
  participant R as OSD replica
  participant B as BlueStore
  A->>O: IoCtx::operate(oid, WriteOp)
  O->>O: op_submit → _op_submit → _calc_target (pg, CRUSH, acting)
  O->>P: _send_op → MOSDOp روی msgr2
  P->>P: ms_fast_dispatch → enqueue_op → OSDShard
  P->>P: ShardedOpWQ::_process → dequeue_op → do_request → do_op
  P->>P: execute_ctx → prepare_transaction → do_osd_ops
  P->>R: issue_repop → submit_transaction → issue_op (MOSDRepOp)
  P->>B: queue_transactions (تراکنش محلی + pg log)
  R->>R: do_repop → queue_transactions
  R-->>P: MOSDRepOpReply (commit)
  B-->>P: on_commit (پس از kv commit)
  P->>P: eval_repop: همه commit کردند
  P-->>O: MOSDOpReply
  O-->>A: completion (rval=0)
